{"title":"Magma Salamander","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 63 Salamander that attacks with burn (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (2.9% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/magma-salamander\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/magma-salamander?lv=63\">Lv 63 <span>145</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/magma-salamander?lv=64\">Lv 64 <span>56</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/magma-salamander\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>63</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>476</td><td>39.2</td><td>3,150</td><td class=\"muted\">1,428 · 54.9 · 9,450</td><td>145</td><td>in the wilds around 167, -1225</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/magma-salamander?lv=64\" title=\"Pick level 64\"><td><b>64</b></td><td>483</td><td>39.7</td><td>3,200</td><td class=\"muted\">1,449 · 55.6 · 9,600</td><td>56</td><td>in the wilds around 190, -1271</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"magma-salamander\" data-map-level=\"63\">Show level 63 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 3 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 6 recorded drops, 527 total, 17–383 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×17–383</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"salamander-crest\" title=\"Salamander Crest - in 2 of 3 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 3 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/2b93fad57bcaa0db1d86.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Salamander Crest</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"slag-pearl\" title=\"Slag Pearl - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/a490538b1cdac91de9fa.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Slag Pearl</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonscale-head\" title=\"Dragonscale Head - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/756e510937a28ef5481b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonscale Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Good: 1 of 1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\" title=\"Health Potion Large - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Keepers&#39; Drift</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 12</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-486\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1925.9px,726.1px)\"><i style=\"left:1985.4px;top:-723.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:1894.2px;top:-716.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:1993.8px;top:-651.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:2055.2px;top:-693.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:1947.0px;top:-648.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:2061.3px;top:-654.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:2033.2px;top:-778.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:1865.8px;top:-749.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:2013.0px;top:-737.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:2006.4px;top:-740.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:1882.1px;top:-695.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:2072.1px;top:-724.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:1992.5px;top:-737.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:1889.2px;top:-755.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:1919.5px;top:-776.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:2007.4px;top:-667.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1953.9px;top:-658.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:1886.5px;top:-725.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1910.8px;top:-764.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:1867.1px;top:-752.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:1926.4px;top:-658.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:2002.0px;top:-747.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1850.8px;top:-677.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:1861.8px;top:-707.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:1841.8px;top:-677.2px\"></i><i style=\"left